extType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>文本处理</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="236" topLeftY="224" width="132" height="70"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>抽病名、套模板<br/>MedKLIP / MedFILIP</p></content></shape><line startX="382" startY="225" endX="408" endY="225"><border color="rgb(139,148,158)" width="2"/></line><shape type="rect" topLeftX="408" topLeftY="150" width="156" height="150" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><border color="rgb(46,125,91)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="420" topLeftY="162" width="132" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="20" color="rgb(46,125,91)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>③</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="420" topLeftY="194" width="132" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>编码对齐</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="420" topLeftY="224" width="132" height="70"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>核心-外同分解<br/>GloRIA / CP-CLIP</p></content></shape><line startX="566" startY="225" endX="592" endY="225"><border color="rgb(139,148,158)" width="2"/></line><shape type="rect" topLeftX="592" topLeftY="150" width="156" height="150" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><border color="rgb(200,125,20)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="604" topLeftY="162" width="132" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="20" color="rgb(200,125,20)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>④</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="604" topLeftY="194" width="132" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>软标签监督</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="604" topLeftY="224" width="132" height="70"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>类别描述扩散<br/>M3GCD 所在环节</p></content></shape><line startX="750" startY="225" endX="776" endY="225"><border color="rgb(139,148,158)" width="2"/></line><shape type="rect" topLeftX="776" topLeftY="150" width="156" height="150" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><border color="rgb(46,125,91)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="788" topLeftY="162" width="132" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="20" color="rgb(46,125,91)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>⑤</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="788" topLeftY="194" width="132" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>下游任务</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="788" topLeftY="224" width="132" height="70"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.4"><p>分类 / 报告生成<br/>检索 / 分割</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="336" width="884" height="120" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(245,246,247)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="352" width="840" height="28"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="15" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>链路里的三个断点，就是过去几年论文的来源</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="384" width="840" height="62"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.5"><p>· ② 文本脏 → 假阴性、说法不统一（MedCLIP、MedKLIP 在补）<br/>· ③ 对齐粗 → 整图对整文（GloRIA、CP-CLIP、MedFILIP 在补）<br/>· ④ 监督弱 → 标签只有一个词（<strong>M3GCD 用类别描述 + 软标签在补</strong>）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="474" width="884" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14" color="rgb(200,125,20)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>结论：M3GCD 不是替代前面的工作，而是补在链路末端的监督环节。</p></content></shape>
